### Install the "REST Client" VS Code extension, then click "Send Request" above any request.
@host = http://localhost:8000
@key = dev-internal-key

### Health (Redis + Qdrant)
GET {{host}}/health

### Process a document that is ALREADY in S3 (this is what NestJS calls)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents/process
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document_id": "doc-1001",
  "case_id": "case-42",
  "s3_bucket": "my-bucket",
  "s3_key": "cases/42/insurance-letter.pdf",
  "file_type": "pdf",
  "callback_url": "http://api:8000/api/v1/dev/webhook-echo",
  "metadata": { "request_id": "abc-123" }
}

### Poll a job (replace the id)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/jobs/PASTE_JOB_ID_HERE
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Ask a question about a case (RAG)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/case/case-42/query
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is the deadline to submit photographs?" }

### Semantic search only (no LLM)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/case/case-42/search
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "repair estimate", "top_k": 5 }

### Delete a document's vectors
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/documents/doc-1001/index
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{key}}

### See webhook payloads that the built-in echo receiver got (dev only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dev/webhook-echo
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{key}}
